          ...wifeNayin.element === "Kim" && husbandNayin.element === "H\u1ECFa" ? ["NP2 v\xED d\u1EE5 1 (v\u1EE3 Qu\xFD M\xE3o Kim, ch\u1ED3ng \u0110inh M\xE3o H\u1ECFa) vi\u1EBFt 'Kim kh\u1EAFc H\u1ECFa', t\u1EE9c \u0111\u1ECDc l\xE0 v\u1EE3 kh\u1EAFc ch\u1ED3ng (\xE2m kh\u1EAFc d\u01B0\u01A1ng, x\u1EA5u th\u1EE9 2); theo t\u01B0\u01A1ng kh\u1EAFc TVTH tr.8\u20139 th\xEC H\u1ECFa kh\u1EAFc Kim, n\xEAn c\xE2u s\xE1ch c\xF3 l\u1EBD l\xE0 l\u1ED7i ch\xE9p"] : []
