        summary: `N\u1EA1p \xE2m v\u1EE3 sinh n\u1EA1p \xE2m ch\u1ED3ng: ${nayinPair}. NP2: "\u0110\u1EB9p: v\u1EE3 sinh cho ch\u1ED3ng"`,
